  Use a drop-in unit instead of
  editing the vendor file:

[38;5;244m  ┃ [0m[38;5;84m[Service][0m
[38;5;244m  ┃ [0m[38;5;84mEnvironment=PORT=8080[0m
[38;5;244m  ┃ [0m[38;5;84m    ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/app --p[0m
[38;5;244m  ┃ [0m[38;5;84mort ${PORT} --log-level debug --conf[0m
[38;5;244m  ┃ [0m[38;5;84mig /etc/app/config.toml --pid-file /[0m
[38;5;244m  ┃ [0m[38;5;84mrun/app/app.pid[0m

  Then reload. Remember: a clean
  [38;5;214m$PATH[0m is a happy [38;5;214m$PATH[0m!

